{"access":"public","aliases":[],"assertions":[{"claim_ids":["clm_138096f7ff345494150fc199d68913fe2f5b3035c23c5be92471c5b4854c1609"],"opposing_claim_ids":[],"text":"When maxTurns is reached the run stops before the next model call and is still reported successful with no distinguishing flag; the docs suggest comparing toolCalls or message counts, or setting a lower maxTurns and treating a long run as an alert."},{"claim_ids":["clm_e9f03b5b2fbd135e331d6f0c3345c39ab4ec6124de05e87ad26caab4eed37c09"],"opposing_claim_ids":[],"text":"Budgets are checked only at turn and task boundaries, so a run can overshoot its ceiling by up to one model turn; exhausting a budget is reported via a budget_exceeded event and result fields rather than thrown."}],"claim_ids":["clm_138096f7ff345494150fc199d68913fe2f5b3035c23c5be92471c5b4854c1609","clm_e9f03b5b2fbd135e331d6f0c3345c39ab4ec6124de05e87ad26caab4eed37c09"],"created_at":"2026-09-14T02:26:17Z","created_by_operation":"op_860178ba4c194ce28586ca49914e10c8","id":"pg_422a2c67c42b588caef20820fad89b19","maturity":"draft","page_type":"source","path":"pages/sources/open-multi-agent-open-multi-agent-docs-budgets-and-limits-md-eaeb420c4-0820fad89b19.md","record_type":"page","review_state":"mechanically_checked","schema_version":"1.0","source_ids":["src_c8ceca53380f583fad5fb8741540c0d8"],"title":"open-multi-agent/open-multi-agent/docs/budgets-and-limits.md @ eaeb420c4364","updated_at":"2026-09-14T02:26:17Z","updated_by_operation":"op_860178ba4c194ce28586ca49914e10c8"}
